{
  "id": "590",
  "title": "The Womanizer",
  "level": "intermediate",
  "date": "2018-10-31",
  "synopsis": "Lili accuses Little He of being a womanizer.",
  "audioUrl": "https://static.duchinese.net/documents/888/c6b88c64e97e7ebf26607bb216fd52ffb55eaeb6.mp3?1698350609",
  "series": null,
  "fullText": {
    "simplified": "花心大萝卜\n\n丽丽：昨晚你去哪儿了？\n小何：加班，没去哪儿。\n丽丽：你骗人！\n小何：哪有。\n丽丽：我朋友说，昨晚看到你和一个女的在外面吃饭！\n小何：啊！那是我公司的同事。\n丽丽：刚才问你昨晚去哪儿了，你又说没去哪儿！你就是心里有鬼，你这个花心大萝卜！\n小何：只是吃个饭而已，你想多了。\n丽丽：最好是我想多了。我告诉你，想在我眼皮底下玩，哼！没门儿！",
    "traditional": "花心大蘿蔔\n\n麗麗：昨晚你去哪兒了？\n小何：加班，沒去哪兒。\n麗麗：你騙人！\n小何：哪有。\n麗麗：我朋友說，昨晚看到你和一個女的在外面吃飯！\n小何：啊！那是我公司的同事。\n麗麗：剛才問你昨晚去哪兒了，你又說沒去哪兒！你就是心裡有鬼，你這個花心大蘿蔔！\n小何：只是吃個飯而已，你想多了。\n麗麗：最好是我想多了。我告訴你，想在我眼皮底下玩，哼！沒門兒！"
  },
  "sentences": [
    {
      "index": 1,
      "simplified": "\n\n",
      "traditional": "\n\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Womanizer"
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "simplified": "丽丽：昨晚你去哪儿了？",
      "traditional": "麗麗：昨晚你去哪兒了？",
      "pinyin": "lì lì zuó wǎn nǐ qù nǎ'r le",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Lili: Where did you go last night?"
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "simplified": "小何：加班，没去哪儿。",
      "traditional": "小何：加班，沒去哪兒。",
      "pinyin": "xiǎo hé jiā bān méi qù nǎ'r",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Little He: I worked overtime. I didn't go anywhere."
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "simplified": "丽丽：你骗人！",
      "traditional": "麗麗：你騙人！",
      "pinyin": "lì lì nǐ piàn rén",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Lili: You’re lying!"
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "simplified": "小何：哪有。",
      "traditional": "小何：哪有。",
      "pinyin": "xiǎo hé nǎ yǒu",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Little He: No, I’m not."
    },
    {
      "index": 10,
      "simplified": "丽丽：我朋友说，昨晚看到你和一个女的在外面吃饭！",
      "traditional": "麗麗：我朋友說，昨晚看到你和一個女的在外面吃飯！",
      "pinyin": "lì lì wǒ péng you shuō zuó wǎn kàn dào nǐ hé yí ge nǚ de zài wài miàn chī fàn",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 11,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Lili: My friend said she saw you eating out together with a woman yesterday!"
    },
    {
      "index": 12,
      "simplified": "小何：啊！那是我公司的同事。",
      "traditional": "小何：啊！那是我公司的同事。",
      "pinyin": "xiǎo hé a nà shì wǒ gōng sī de tóng shì",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 13,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Little He: Ah! That’s my colleague from work."
    },
    {
      "index": 14,
      "simplified": "丽丽：刚才问你昨晚去哪儿了，你又说没去哪儿！",
      "traditional": "麗麗：剛才問你昨晚去哪兒了，你又說沒去哪兒！",
      "pinyin": "lì lì gāng cái wèn nǐ zuó wǎn qù nǎ'r le nǐ yòu shuō méi qù nǎ'r",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 15,
      "simplified": "你就是心里有鬼，你这个花心大萝卜！",
      "traditional": "你就是心裡有鬼，你這個花心大蘿蔔！",
      "pinyin": "nǐ jiù shì xīn li yǒu guǐ nǐ zhè ge huā xīn dà luó bo",
      "english": "Lili: Just now when I asked you where you went last night, you still said you didn’t go anywhere!"
    },
    {
      "index": 16,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "You have a guilty conscience. You’re such a womanizer!"
    },
    {
      "index": 17,
      "simplified": "小何：只是吃个饭而已，你想多了。",
      "traditional": "小何：只是吃個飯而已，你想多了。",
      "pinyin": "xiǎo hé zhǐ shì chī ge fàn ér yǐ nǐ xiǎng duō le",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 18,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Little He: We just had a meal, you’re overthinking things."
    },
    {
      "index": 19,
      "simplified": "丽丽：最好是我想多了。",
      "traditional": "麗麗：最好是我想多了。",
      "pinyin": "lì lì zuì hǎo shì wǒ xiǎng duō le",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 20,
      "simplified": "我告诉你，想在我眼皮底下玩，哼！没门儿！",
      "traditional": "我告訴你，想在我眼皮底下玩，哼！沒門兒！",
      "pinyin": "wǒ gào su nǐ xiǎng zài wǒ yǎn pí dǐ xia wán hēng méi mén'r",
      "english": "Lili: It better just be me overthinking things."
    },
    {
      "index": 21,
      "simplified": "",
      "traditional": "",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "I’m telling you, if you’re trying to play around right in front of my nose… Hmph! No way!"
    }
  ],
